<title>UK: Italy sets $1.5 billion five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Italy sets $1.5 billion five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ITALY</p>
<p> AMT    $1.5 BLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -12.5 BP  PAY DATE    12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.803    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  REOFFER    99.803</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/HK    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ITALY     TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
